                    "sense_definition": "Damaged or not functioning correctly; a non-standard form of broken.",
                    "learner_level": "C1",
                    "frequency": "Low",
                    "semantic_group_id": "condition",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "If it ain't <w>broke</w>, don't fix it.",
