                    "sense_definition": "Paper or board waste created during the manufacturing process that is often recycled.",
                    "learner_level": "C2",
                    "frequency": "VeryLow",
                    "semantic_group_id": "material",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The paper mill collects the <w>broke</w> to be repulped and used again.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Бумажная фабрика собирает <w>оборотный брак</w> для переработки и повторного использования.",
                                "zh": "造纸厂收集<w>废纸</w>进行重新制浆和再利用。"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Using <w>broke</w> in the production line helps reduce material costs significantly.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
